+ PAK_industry_order:0 "Commission a Civilian Factory"
+ PAK_industry_order_desc:0 "Builds one civilian factory and provides a construction slot. Once per state and no more than three successful projects nationwide.\n\nDuration: §Y180 days§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−7.5 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled.\nIf its requirements cease to be met, the programme is cancelled and its prepaid treasury cost is refunded."
