+ PAK_telecom_network_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y120 days§!."
+ PAK_education_pilot_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y0.5 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
+ PAK_education_pilot:0 "Pilot Local Literacy Classes"
+ PAK_education_pilot_desc:0 "Raises literacy by 0.5 percentage points. No more than three successful programmes nationwide.\n\nDuration: §Y120 days§!.\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−0.5 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled."
