+ PAK_education_exchange_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y0.5 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
+ PAK_education_exchange:0 "Fund a Computing Exchange"
+ PAK_education_exchange_desc:0 "Grants a one-use 25% research bonus for a computing technology. No more than two successful programmes.\n\nDuration: §Y120 days§!.\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−0.5 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled."
