+ PAK_coast_logistics_desc:0 "Builds one office and one fossil power plant. Once each in Balochistan and Sindh; normal building upkeep continues to apply.\n\nDuration: §Y180 days§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−12 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled.\nIf its requirements cease to be met, the programme is cancelled and its prepaid treasury cost is refunded."
