+ PAK_province_health_desc:0 "Improved basic services raise regional productivity by 10 points. Once per owned core state.\n\nDuration: §Y90 days§!.\nCost: §Y25 political power§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−0.5 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled.\nIf its requirements cease to be met, the programme is cancelled and its prepaid treasury cost is refunded."
+ PAK_province_health_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y90 days§!."
+ PAK_province_connection_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y3.5 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
