+ PAK_province_connection_desc:0 "Builds one infrastructure level in the target region. Once per listed target state.\n\nDuration: §Y180 days§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−3.5 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled.\nIf its requirements cease to be met, the programme is cancelled and its prepaid treasury cost is refunded."
+ PAK_province_connection_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y180 days§!."
+ PAK_army_exercise_cost_tt:0 "§Y20§! command power"
+ PAK_army_exercise:0 "Conduct an Army Exercise"
