+ PAK_army_exercise_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y30 days§!."
+ PAK_army_officers_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y0.5 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
+ PAK_army_officers:0 "Improve Officer Education"
+ PAK_army_officers_desc:0 "Improves §Yofficer education by one level§!. Available at most twice. International officer education requires membership in a faction or NATO.\n\nDuration: §Y60 days§!.\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−0.5 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled.\nIf its requirements cease to be met, the programme is cancelled and its prepaid treasury cost is refunded."
