+ PAK_services_planning_cost_tt:0 "§Y25§! command power"
+ PAK_services_planning:0 "Coordinate Air and Naval Planning"
+ PAK_services_planning_desc:0 "Grants 5 air and 5 naval experience after completion.\n\nDuration: §Y45 days§!.\nAvailable again §Y180 days§! after completion or cancellation."
+ PAK_services_planning_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y45 days§!."
+ PAK_services_safety_idea:0 "Review Flight Safety and Maintenance"
+ PAK_services_safety_idea_desc:0 "Standard maintenance procedures and thorough safety checks reduce preventable accidents in our air force."
+ PAK_services_safety_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y0.5 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
+ PAK_services_safety:0 "Review Flight Safety and Maintenance"
+ PAK_services_safety_desc:0 "Reduces air accidents by 5% for 180 days after completion.\n\nDuration: §Y90 days§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−0.5 billion§!.\nAvailable again §Y365 days§! after completion or cancellation."
+ PAK_services_safety_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y90 days§!."
+ PAK_nuclear_mine:0 "Commission Dera Ghazi Khan's Uranium Mine"
+ PAK_nuclear_mine_desc:0 "Queues construction of a §Yuranium mine at Dera Ghazi Khan§!. The deposit supports one mine. Construction requires normal building capacity.\n\nCost: §Y25 political power§!."
+ PAK_nuclear_mine_completion_tt:0 "Takes effect immediately."
+ PAK_nuclear_shelter:0 "Commission a Civilian Shelter"
+ PAK_nuclear_shelter_desc:0 "Queues construction of §Y1 civilian shelter level§! in the target state. Requires construction capacity, room below the level cap and no shelter already under construction there.\n\nCost: §Y25 political power§!.\nAvailable again §Y120 days§! after completion or cancellation."
+ PAK_nuclear_shelter_completion_tt:0 "Takes effect immediately."
+ PAK_china_delegation:0 "Send a Delegation to Beijing"
+ PAK_china_delegation_desc:0 "Reopens talks with China made available by completed focuses. Declined offers can be resubmitted after §Y180 days§!; approved projects can proceed once sufficient funds are available.\n\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nAvailable again §Y180 days§! after completion or cancellation."
+ PAK_china_delegation_completion_tt:0 "Takes effect immediately."
+ PAK_china_cancel:0 "Terminate the Chinese Security Treaty"
+ PAK_china_cancel_desc:0 "Terminates the active Chinese security treaty after 180 days' notice. Trade and development agreements are not automatically terminated.\n\nDuration: §Y180 days§!.\nCost: §Y75 political power§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled."
+ PAK_china_cancel_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y180 days§!."
+ PAK_west_delegation:0 "Renew Western Diplomatic Contacts"
+ PAK_west_delegation_desc:0 "Reopens talks with Western partners made available by completed focuses. Declined offers can be resubmitted after §Y180 days§!; approved projects can proceed once sufficient funds are available.\n\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nAvailable again §Y180 days§! after completion or cancellation."
+ PAK_west_delegation_completion_tt:0 "Takes effect immediately."
+ PAK_west_cancel:0 "Terminate the Western Security Treaty"
+ PAK_west_cancel_desc:0 "Terminates the active American security treaty after 180 days' notice. Trade and education agreements remain separate arrangements.\n\nDuration: §Y180 days§!.\nCost: §Y75 political power§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled."
+ PAK_west_cancel_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y180 days§!."
+ PAK_regional_round:0 "Begin Another Regional Consultation"
+ PAK_regional_round_desc:0 "Reopens talks with the selected regional partner or implements an approved project. Requires the corresponding focus and, for declined offers, the end of the negotiation cooldown. Completed projects and offers awaiting a response cannot be selected.\n\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nAvailable again §Y180 days§! after completion or cancellation."
+ PAK_regional_round_completion_tt:0 "Takes effect immediately."
+ PAK_regional_integration_idea:0 "Help Refugees Enter Civilian Life"
+ PAK_regional_integration_idea_desc:0 "Additional advice centres and employment services help refugees take part in the social and economic life of their new communities."
+ PAK_regional_integration_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y1 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
+ PAK_regional_integration:0 "Help Refugees Enter Civilian Life"
+ PAK_regional_integration_desc:0 "Improves the §Yrefugee integration rate§! by §G5%§! for §Y365 days§! after completion. Advice and employment services help refugees settle into our communities.\n\nDuration: §Y180 days§!.\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−1 billion§!.\nAvailable again §Y365 days§! after completion or cancellation."
+ PAK_regional_integration_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y180 days§!."
+ PAK_civilian_supremacy_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y0.5 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
+ PAK_civilian_supremacy:0 "Enact Civilian Budget Supremacy"
+ PAK_civilian_supremacy_desc:0 "Transfers full control of public finances to civilian government and removes the remaining §YOne-Pillar State§! national spirit. Requires peace, at least §Y60% stability§!, §Y50 military opinion§! and no parallel armed structures throughout the programme. A PML(Q) government must first agree to a civilian transition.\n\nDuration: §Y180 days§!.\nCost: §Y100 political power§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−0.5 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled.\nIf its requirements cease to be met, the programme is cancelled and its prepaid treasury cost is refunded."
+ PAK_civilian_supremacy_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y180 days§!."
+ PAK_youth_opportunities_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y1 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
+ PAK_youth_opportunities:0 "Education Instead of Radicalisation"
+ PAK_youth_opportunities_desc:0 "Education and employment will give young people a future. Removes §YYouth Radicalisation§! after completion. Requires education and industrial reforms; the programme cannot proceed during armed mobilisation.\n\nDuration: §Y180 days§!.\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−1 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled.\nIf its requirements cease to be met, the programme is cancelled and its prepaid treasury cost is refunded."
+ PAK_youth_opportunities_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y180 days§!."
+ PAK_american_aid_review:0 "Request a Review of Suspended US Aid"
+ PAK_american_aid_review_desc:0 "Asks Washington to resume §YAmerican aid§!. The US government decides whether to accept.\n\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nAvailable again §Y180 days§! after completion or cancellation."
+ PAK_american_aid_review_completion_tt:0 "Takes effect immediately."
+ PAK_tribal_dialogue_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y0.5 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
+ PAK_tribal_dialogue:0 "Begin Dialogue in the Tribal Areas"
+ PAK_tribal_dialogue_desc:0 "Local representatives will seek a political way out of the Waziristan crisis. Raises stability by §G1 percentage point§! and opens dialogue; the insurgency remains a separate security challenge.\n\nDuration: §Y90 days§!.\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−0.5 billion§!.\nContinues after a change of government as long as its requirements remain fulfilled."
+ PAK_tribal_dialogue_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y90 days§!."
+ PAK_crisis_cabinet_cost_tt:0 "Treasury: §Y0.5 billion§! (paid on commencement)"
+ PAK_crisis_cabinet:0 "Convene a Crisis Cabinet"
+ PAK_crisis_cabinet_desc:0 "A limited crisis programme raises stability by one percentage point. Available only below 45% stability.\n\nDuration: §Y90 days§!.\nCost: §Y50 political power§!.\nTreasury on commencement: §R−0.5 billion§!.\nAvailable again §Y365 days§! after completion or cancellation."
+ PAK_crisis_cabinet_completion_tt:0 "The programme is completed after §Y90 days§!."
+ PAK_political_campaigns:0 "Campaigns and Party Organisation"
+ PAK_political_campaigns_desc:0 "Pakistan's political movements need support in towns and villages. Rallies and campaign offices allow legal parties to attract new supporters."
+ PAK_party_programmes:0 "Governing Party Programmes"
+ PAK_party_programmes_desc:0 "Our government programme must prove itself through practical measures. Recurring initiatives support our chosen policies, while larger projects leave lasting results."
+ PAK_development_programmes:0 "Regional and Economic Development"
+ PAK_development_programmes_desc:0 "From the Indus farmlands to our industrial centres, every region needs investment. Completed focuses unlock new projects for the economy and public services."
+ PAK_security_programmes:0 "Defence and Civil Protection"
+ PAK_security_programmes_desc:0 "Training, technical support and civilian preparedness are essential to a dependable security policy. Our programmes will better prepare the armed forces and the population for a crisis."
+ PAK_diplomatic_programmes:0 "Pakistani Diplomacy"
+ PAK_diplomatic_programmes_desc:0 "Our diplomats are pursuing economic cooperation, regional agreements and security treaties. Negotiations require patience and firm commitments from both sides."
+ PAK_national_reconciliation:0 "State and Society"
+ PAK_national_reconciliation_desc:0 "Military privileges, limited opportunities and regional tensions weigh on the republic. Institutional reforms and targeted assistance will strengthen public confidence in the state."